<title>JAPAN: Mitsuba - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsuba - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 38.50		vs	   37.10</p>
<p> Operating	    1.68		vs	    1.41</p>
<p> Current		1.68		vs	    1.46</p>
<p> Net		  778    million    vs	  684    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.91 yen	  vs	   18.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     38 million	  vs	  36 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsuba Corporation is an electrical equipment maker affiliated with Honda Motor Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
